WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:12,900
Do you have to be on hormone blockers with breast cancer treatments?

00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,980
I really hate to go back on either one of these.

00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:20,660
Well, hormone blockers with breast cancer, if you have really aggressive breast cancer,

00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:25,460
has been shown to decrease it.

00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:32,300
So I would say this, I don't know who asked this question, I would say yes, you should go

00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,300
on that.

00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,420
This is saying person asked this question.

00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:41,420
I would say you need to do your studies of the Zobata, personally, I wouldn't go on that.

00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:45,420
But personally, I think this might be the right thing to do right now.

